WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.123
Rural America runs on infrastructure nobody tested for it.

2
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:16.216
66.3 million Americans live in rural places. 1,958 counties are nonmetro.

3
00:00:16.566 --> 00:00:19.425
719 counties have no Medicare-registered hospital.

4
00:00:20.825 --> 00:00:25.604
RuralSim is a reproducible digital twin of rural America.

5
00:00:25.953 --> 00:00:33.270
Five pilot counties rebuilt in 3D from public data, and a table for every county in the nation.

6
00:00:34.671 --> 00:00:36.207
Test before you build.

7
00:00:36.557 --> 00:00:42.509
Ten experiments. Each pass bar is set before it runs, and every miss is published.

8
00:00:44.671 --> 00:00:47.167
Measured on people, not averages.

9
00:00:47.517 --> 00:00:51.720
If the worst-off 10% end up worse off, the plan fails.

10
00:00:53.671 --> 00:01:02.460
Hard limits, by design. Synthetic people only. No one relocated. Political variables never enter the objective.

11
00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:07.423
RuralSim. The test range for rural America.
